5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi everyone! I'm excited to help pick the best plan. I want to make sure we can actually finish the work on time, so I'll look into regional firms tendering for earth-moving and depot phasing notes.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to be here. To ensure our choice aligns with the actual usage and environmental realities of the site, I shall examine the timed counts of weekday crossings and the drainage callouts.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I want to know who will take care of the park every day. I will look into the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services, and also the volunteer groups working with the division.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,I believe we must evaluate the longevity of our previous projects to avoid repeating past mistakes. I will look into the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. To understand the long-term financial sustainability of the park, I will look into the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the terms of the regional habitat fund.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"Does anyone else think we should check the soil or the weather? I'm a bit worried about the ground, but I think my choices cover the construction side well!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, your focus on the construction phase is prudent. I suspect the drainage callouts I've selected may provide the environmental context you seek regarding the ground's behavior during peak weather events.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,I think it's a good idea to check the weather. I hope the people who work there are happy and have enough help to keep the park beautiful for everyone.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Minato, your concern for the staff is valid. However, we must also ensure the physical assets are durable. I will focus on the historical data to see what actually lasts in this city.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree with Minako. While the initial vision is often inspiring, the true test is how the costs evolve over time. I hope the ledger reveals a sustainable path for the city's budget.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'm glad we all agree on being careful! I'll stick with my choices for now, but I'm really looking forward to hearing what you all find out. This is going to be interesting!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, the anticipation is the best part of any investigation. I shall remain with my selections, as understanding the intersection of human traffic and water management seems essential for a rational decision.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I will stay with my choices too. I want to see if there are enough kind people and workers to help the park stay healthy and happy for a long time.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will also maintain my selections. Understanding the gap between the original design and the current state of previous works is the only way to ensure we choose a truly sustainable plan.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I shall also remain with my choices. It is better to be certain of the financial implications now than to be surprised by the accounts in a few years.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm all set! Let's get the information we need so we can pick the best plan for the city. I can't wait to see what we discover!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I am also prepared. I look forward to synthesizing our findings into a logical conclusion.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Minato,,I am ready too. I hope the information helps us find a plan that is gentle on the people who will look after it.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Minato,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Minako,,I am ready. Let us see if the facts support the visions presented in the plans. I look forward to the results.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
