28,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I am ready as well. I look forward to seeing if the financial data aligns with the ambitions of the proposed plans. Let us proceed.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
